			message: '#^Call to function is_subclass_of\(\) with ''Omnibill\\\\Afnor\\\\AfnorGatewayFactory''\|''Omnibill\\\\ChorusPro\\\\ChorusProGatewayFactory''\|''Omnibill\\\\Email\\\\EmailGatewayFactory''\|''Omnibill\\\\Odoo\\\\OdooGatewayFactory''\|''Omnibill\\\\Pennylane\\\\PennylaneGatewayFactory'' and ''Omnibill\\\\GatewayFactoryInterface'' will always evaluate to true\.$#'
